message: "If you use this work, please cite the Zenodo record below."
title: "Global Spectral Theory of Everything"
authors:
  - family-names: "Olbryk"
    given-names: "Grzegorz"
    email: "g.olbryk@gmail.com"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/golbryk/global-spectral-toe"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A background-independent, relational, global-spectral foundational
  framework in which physical structure emerges from global spectral
  properties of a relational system rather than local dynamics on a
  predefined spacetime. Includes Random Matrix Theory falsification tests.
  This is a foundational construction with an explicit scientific-status and
  falsifier map (see docs/STATUS_AND_LIMITS.md); it is NOT a complete
  Theory of Everything and makes no "TOE solved" claim.
keywords:
  - global spectral theory
  - background independence
  - relational physics
  - random matrix theory
  - spectral triple
  - falsification
